    "How Israel's faith survived catastrophe: Ezekiel and Second Isaiah in Babylon; the return, the Second Temple, Ezra, and Nehemiah; the Psalms; the wisdom of Proverbs and Ecclesiastes; Job's protest; Ruth, Esther, and the Song of Songs; Daniel and apocalyptic; and the closing of the canon.",
